<title>USA: Medical Industries sets reverse stock split.</title>
<headline>Medical Industries sets reverse stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BOYNTON BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Industries of America Inc said on Thursday it has declared a 1-for-20 reverse split of its outstanding and authorized common shares, effective November 1, 1996.</p>
<p>The split will reduce the number of outstanding common shares to about 1.4 million, Medical Industries said. The company's common shares closed trading on Wednesday at $0.22 per share.</p>
